    "name": "The Farming Frontier",
    "steam_appid": 2468970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/2cd96c1144b458e2df805871448a63aa.webp?t=1753867927\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Farming Frontier</strong> is a relaxing farming adventure game where you can chop wood, mine ores, fish, grow crops, bake bread, and raise cattle at your own pace. Alongside the open-ended sandbox gameplay, the game also follows a light, linear story where your farming skills are key to overcoming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.poster.avif?t=1753867927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.webm?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.mp4?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.poster.avif?t=1753867927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.webm?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.mp4?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, everything is connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defend your frontier, you must train soldiers \u2014 but soldiers need weapons and a strong economy to survive. As the farmer, it\u2019s your responsibility to manage and grow the economy that supports them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/e9f7d4e51f8fcefbcb78e1366b5282c6.avif?t=1753867927\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you will need wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and employ woodcutters to process logs into usable wood for constructing buildings. Some structures also require stone, so you\u2019ll need to quarry rocks and refine them into building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your village by building a fishery, a bakery, and a mill to produce food for your growing population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/f5f0f8c60dd64add1fde14333b99476c.avif?t=1753867927\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your peasants need comfortable homes to rest and eat when they are tired and hungry. Keep their houses stocked with food to keep morale high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn crafting to speed up production and unlock new tools and upgrades that make your frontier thrive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/2cd96c1144b458e2df805871448a63aa.webp?t=1753867927\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Farming Frontier</strong> is a relaxing farming adventure game where you can chop wood, mine ores, fish, grow crops, bake bread, and raise cattle at your own pace. Alongside the open-ended sandbox gameplay, the game also follows a light, linear story where your farming skills are key to overcoming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.poster.avif?t=1753867927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.webm?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.mp4?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.poster.avif?t=1753867927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.webm?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.mp4?t=1753867927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, everything is connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defend your frontier, you must train soldiers \u2014 but soldiers need weapons and a strong economy to survive. As the farmer, it\u2019s your responsibility to manage and grow the economy that supports them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/e9f7d4e51f8fcefbcb78e1366b5282c6.avif?t=1753867927\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you will need wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and employ woodcutters to process logs into usable wood for constructing buildings. Some structures also require stone, so you\u2019ll need to quarry rocks and refine them into building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your village by building a fishery, a bakery, and a mill to produce food for your growing population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/f5f0f8c60dd64add1fde14333b99476c.avif?t=1753867927\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your peasants need comfortable homes to rest and eat when they are tired and hungry. Keep their houses stocked with food to keep morale high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn crafting to speed up production and unlock new tools and upgrades that make your frontier thrive.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Farming Frontier is a farming adventure game with a sandbox economy and a linear story. Grow crops, raise cattle, go fishing, master crafting, and battle enemies as you build your frontier.",
